ZYXsadVGpzQryS0nNLtm1zDR9YflujA_70mv8zg&oe=6A11B963"}, {"file_name": "Hotel New Screenshot.png", "id": "647639044768317", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391917_647639048101650_4908855903828818819_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WwvIO1yu5RQQ7kNvwFtFgd3&_nc_oc=AdpsI5GXXTmKPHCR9YazN23e1HjRNDqUscJtIAwaP92RLf6Wvs-oPAh-EbOLw9MEp9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4LAD_D_o547LwbyXuPFmJX3oPR_hv1cmxfJ0g3HHJolw&oe=6A11C1A7"}, {"file_name": "Roofmaxx New Screenshot.png", "id": "685271690607202", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391872_685271693940535_7763026046656608909_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jOhFcdTzXPcQ7kNvwEpJJIb&_nc_oc=AdpNa9ecVKO8Gnj4ilKScq8HNAgdGpBCaDgtbxc84t0_jfX72AhR6rdQAmwfzogIh2o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7ngQhvIsVxSq-7SK9C_LQqj-JFim40nRfEpH7aMTV05g&oe=6A11A500"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Customer XR Showcase", "keywords": ["Business", "showcase", "retail", "fire", "customization"], "long_description": "**Included Experiences:**\n\n\ud83d\udd39 **Kitchen Saver \u2013 Kitchen Customization Experience**  \nStep into a stylish kitchen environment and choose your ideal cabinets, countertops, and color combinations. With hand-tracking and an interactive bubble-popping mechanic, users enjoy a gamified design journey guided by a friendly voiceover\u2014ideal for boosting customer confidence and conversion in home remodeling sales.\n\n\ud83d\udd39 **Bath Fitter \u2013 Bathroom Customization Experience**  \nExplore a modular bathroom setup and choose tub styles, fixtures, and finishes in a free-form environment. This experience creates a seamless and engaging customization journey for customers looking to upgrade their bathroom.\n\n\ud83d\udd39 **Egress Pros \u2013 Fire Escape Simulation**  \nUsers experience what it\u2019s like to navigate a fire escape scenario using the Egress Pros Fire Escape Window. Designed to raise awareness and train homeowners or tenants, this tool makes safety education feel urgent, real, and memorable.\n\n\ud83d\udd39 **Roof Maxx \u2013 Roof Treatment Experience**  \nThis experience uses dynamic animations and simple interaction to explain how an ecofriendly solution can extend the life of a roof\u2014making complex services clear and compelling.\n\n\ud83d\udd39 **All Seasons Hotel \u2013 Proof of Concept**  \nDesigned as a proof of concept, this interactive environment showcases how hotels can use XR to give guests a virtual tour of amenities, room types, and key selling features before they book.", "short_description": "This showcase brings together our most impactful and innovative XR experiences across a range of industries\u2014all in one easy-to-navigate VR app.\n\nDesigned for professionals, clients, and curious explorers alike, the Customer XR Showcase lets you dive into powerful simulations that demonstrate how immersive technology is revolutionizing the way companies connect with their audiences."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.customerxr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Customer XR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.customerxr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "877379582865093"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [],